    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LATER is a short narrative-driven hidden object game about doing things later. Explore a lovingly hand-drawn 2D comic world where a mysterious, cat-like creature invites you to a game of hide and seek. What starts as a playful challenge quickly turns into an intense journey through inner conflicts and the darker sides of procrastination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/b16f21261b1162c58dd93dfda78687f9.poster.avif?t=1754641878\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/b16f21261b1162c58dd93dfda78687f9.webm?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/b16f21261b1162c58dd93dfda78687f9.mp4?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unique Hidden Object Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search for a lovable creature hiding in an increasingly cluttered apartment \u2013 and maybe uncover a few secrets along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short and Impactful </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in around 30 minutes, offering a unique experience in one sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric 2D Comic Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly hand-drawn black-and-white visuals with a melancholic undertone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Surreal Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A short, narrative-driven game that will surprise you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully playable using just the left mouse button \u2013 perfect for a relaxed and accessible experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/7e0f187626d380edb9834d7de62dda26.poster.avif?t=1754641878\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/7e0f187626d380edb9834d7de62dda26.webm?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/7e0f187626d380edb9834d7de62dda26.mp4?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LATER is a short narrative-driven hidden object game about doing things later. Explore a lovingly hand-drawn 2D comic world where a mysterious, cat-like creature invites you to a game of hide and seek. What starts as a playful challenge quickly turns into an intense journey through inner conflicts and the darker sides of procrastination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/b16f21261b1162c58dd93dfda78687f9.poster.avif?t=1754641878\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/b16f21261b1162c58dd93dfda78687f9.webm?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/b16f21261b1162c58dd93dfda78687f9.mp4?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unique Hidden Object Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search for a lovable creature hiding in an increasingly cluttered apartment \u2013 and maybe uncover a few secrets along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short and Impactful </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in around 30 minutes, offering a unique experience in one sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric 2D Comic Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly hand-drawn black-and-white visuals with a melancholic undertone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Surreal Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A short, narrative-driven game that will surprise you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully playable using just the left mouse button \u2013 perfect for a relaxed and accessible experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/7e0f187626d380edb9834d7de62dda26.poster.avif?t=1754641878\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/7e0f187626d380edb9834d7de62dda26.webm?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/7e0f187626d380edb9834d7de62dda26.mp4?t=1754641878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
